1
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:10,740
Square kilometer

2
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:35,610
To measure area of large pieces of land of a province, city, forest… need use area unit square kilometer.

3
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:45,450
So what is square kilometer?

4
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:58,780
Square kilometer is also area unit.

5
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:14,460
Square kilometer is area of square with side length 1 km.

6
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:27,360
Square kilometer abbreviated as km<sup>2</sup>.

7
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:37,850
1 km<sup>2</sup> = 1 000 000 m<sup>2</sup>

8
00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:52,680
For example: Area of Hanoi capital (according to 2020 data) is 921 km<sup>2</sup>.

